    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Level 5 Bastion Facility</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Membership in the Purple Dragon Knights<br /><strong>Space:</strong> Vast<br /><strong>Hirelings:</strong> 1<br /><strong>Order:</strong> Empower</p><p>An enclosed open chamber with a pool, one of its entrances underwater, where the hireling keeps the den and makes visiting amethyst dragons comfortable.</p><p><strong>Empower: Psionic Defenses.</strong> Latent draconic power fills the den, letting you train in psionic combat 8 hours a day for 7 days. You then gain Resistance to Psychic damage for 7 days.</p><p><em>Source: Forgotten Realms: Heroes of Faerûn.</em></p>",
